OLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-XU","scope_ref":"P2","token":"xu","meaning":"退回不合格品是否拆解","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"BOOLEAN","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-EC","scope_ref":"P2","token":"EC","meaning":"期望总成本","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PI","scope_ref":"P3","token":"pi","meaning":"节点i的次品率","unit":"dimensionless","role":"PARAMETER","shape":"INDEXED","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":["i"]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-CI","scope_ref":"P3","token":"ci","meaning":"节点i的购买单价或装配成本","unit":"dimensionless","role":"PARAMETER","shape":"INDEXED","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":["i"]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-DI","scope_ref":"P3","token":"di","meaning":"节点i的检测成本","unit":"dimensionless","role":"PARAMETER","shape":"INDEXED","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":["i"]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-RI","scope_ref":"P3","token":"ri","meaning":"节点i的拆解费用","unit":"dimensionless","role":"PARAMETER","shape":"INDEXED","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":["i"]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-ECI","scope_ref":"P3","token":"ECi","meaning":"节点i的期望成本","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"INDEXED","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":["i"]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-PHAT","scope_ref":"P4","token":"phat","meaning":"次品率后验均值","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"PROBABILITY","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"SymbolSpec","value":{"symbol_id":"S-EC4","scope_ref":"P4","token":"EC4","meaning":"不确定性下的期望总成本","unit":"dimensionless","role":"VARIABLE","shape":"SCALAR","domain":"NONNEGATIVE_REAL","index_set":[]}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"零配件 1 与零配件 2 的次品事件相互独立，且同一批次内各零配件是否合格相互独立。","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"零配件 1 与零配件 2 的次品事件相互独立，且同一批次内各零配件是否合格相互独立"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"抽样检测中，样本中不合格品数服从二项分布，且抽样比例足够小，可用二项分布精确计算而无需超几何修正。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"抽样检测中，样本中不合格品数服从二项分布，且抽样比例足够小，可用二项分布精确计算而无需超几何修正"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-CONSTANT-RATES","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"问题 2 和问题 3 中给出的次品率为真实次品率，各阶段次品率不随检测、拆解等操作而改变。","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"问题 2 和问题 3 中给出的次品率为真实次品率，各阶段次品率不随检测、拆解等操作而改变"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-REPAIR-NO-DAMAGE","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"拆解过程不会对零配件造成损坏，拆解后的零配件与原始零配件具有相同的次品率。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"拆解过程不会对零配件造成损坏，拆解后的零配件与原始零配件具有相同的次品率"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-REPLACEMENT-COST","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"用户退回的不合格品，企业无条件调换，调换损失为每件固定值，且调换后的新产品按相同生产流程处理。","source_type":"GIVEN","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"用户退回的不合格品，企业无条件调换，调换损失为每件固定值，且调换后的新产品按相同生产流程处理"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-EXPECTED-VALUE-CRITERION","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"企业以期望总成本最小化（或等价地期望利润最大化）作为决策准则，不考虑风险偏好。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"企业以期望总成本最小化（或等价地期望利润最大化）作为决策准则，不考虑风险偏好"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INFINITE-HORIZON","scope_ref":"P2","statement":"问题 2 和问题 3 的决策为单批次稳态决策，不考虑库存、时间折扣和多批次间的动态耦合。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"问题 2 和问题 3 的决策为单批次稳态决策，不考虑库存、时间折扣和多批次间的动态耦合"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-SAMPLING-ESTIMATE-UNCERTAINTY","scope_ref":"P4","statement":"问题 4 中，次品率由抽样检测得到，视为具有抽样误差的估计值，需用区间估计或贝叶斯方法刻画其不确定性。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":["DA-RAW"],"risk_level":"MEDIUM","testable":true,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":false,"e1_span":"问题 4 中，次品率由抽样检测得到，视为具有抽样误差的估计值，需用区间估计或贝叶斯方法刻画其不确定性"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q1-REJECT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X > c | p = p0) <= 0.05","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-X"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C","S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"情形(1)：P(X > c | p = p₀) ≤ 0.05，即在真实次品率为 10% 时，拒收的概率不超过 5%"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q1-ACCEPT","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X <= c | p = p0) >= 0.90","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-X"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C","S-P0"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"情形(2)：P(X ≤ c | p = p₀) ≥ 0.90，即在真实次品率为 10% 时，接收的概率至少为 90%"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q2-EC","scope_ref":"P2","expression":"E[C] = f(x1,x2,xf,xr,xu; p1,p2,pf,c1,c2,d1,d2,a,df,s,l,r)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-EC"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X1","S-X2","S-XF","S-XR","S-XU","S-P1","S-P2","S-PF","S-C1","S-C2","S-D1","S-D2","S-A","S-DF","S-S","S-L","S-R"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"对每种决策组合，计算单件成品的期望总成本 E[C]"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q3-REC","scope_ref":"P3","expression":"EC_i = min_{decisions} g(EC_children, p_i, c_i, d_i, r_i)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-ECI"],"rhs_symbols":["S-PI","S-CI","S-DI","S-RI"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"对每个节点，枚举检测/不检测、拆解/不拆解的组合，选择期望成本最小的方案"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q4-PHAT","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"phat = (X+1)/(n+2)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-PHAT"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-N"],"equation_type":"DERIVED","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"可用其均值 p̂ = (X+1)/(n+2) 作为点估计代入原模型"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-Q4-EC","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"E[C] = ∫ E[C | p] f(p) dp","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-EC4"],"rhs_symbols":["S-PHAT"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"e1","e1_span":"E[C] = ∫ E[C | p] f(p) dp"}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M1","problem_refs":["P1"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING"],"variable_refs":["S-N","S-C","S-X"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["E-Q1-REJECT","E-Q1-ACCEPT"],"constraints":["P(X > c | p = p0) <= 0.05","P(X <= c | p = p0) >= 0.90"],"objective":"minimize n subject to constraints","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M2","problem_refs":["P2"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-CONSTANT-RATES","A-REPAIR-NO-DAMAGE","A-REPLACEMENT-COST","A-EXPECTED-VALUE-CRITERION","A-INFINITE-HORIZON"],"variable_refs":["S-X1","S-X2","S-XF","S-XR","S-XU","S-EC"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P1","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-P2","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-PF","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-C1","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-C2","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-D1","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-D2","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-A","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-DF","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-S","value":10},{"symbol_ref":"S-L","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-R","value":0.5}],"equation_refs":["E-Q2-EC"],"constraints":[],"objective":"minimize E[C]","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M3","problem_refs":["P3"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-CONSTANT-RATES","A-REPAIR-NO-DAMAGE","A-REPLACEMENT-COST","A-EXPECTED-VALUE-CRITERION","A-INFINITE-HORIZON"],"variable_refs":["S-ECI"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-PI","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-CI","value":1},{"symbol_ref":"S-DI","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-RI","value":0.5}],"equation_refs":["E-Q3-REC"],"constraints":[],"objective":"minimize EC_i at each node","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M4","problem_refs":["P4"],"assumption_refs":["A-SAMPLING-ESTIMATE-UNCERTAINTY","A-EXPECTED-VALUE-CRITERION"],"variable_refs":["S-PHAT","S-EC4"],"parameter_refs":[],"equation_refs":["E-Q4-PHAT","E-Q4-EC"],"constraints":[],"objective":"minimize E[C] under uncertainty","dependencies":["M2","M3"]}}],"code":"const fs = require('fs');
function binomCdf(k, n, p) {
  let c = 0;
  let term = Math.pow(1-p, n);
  c = term;
  for (let i = 1; i <= k; i++) {
    term = term * (n - i + 1) / i * p / (1 - p);
    c += term;
  }
  return c;
}
function findMinN() {
  for (let n = 1; n <= 200; n++) {
    for (let c = 0; c < n; c++) {
      const pReject = 1 - binomCdf(c, n, 0.1);
      const pAccept = binomCdf(c, n, 0.1);
      if (pReject <= 0.05 && pAccept >= 0.90) {
        return { n, c, pReject, pAccept };
      }
    }
  }
  return null;
}
const q1 = findMinN();
const out = {
  n_q1: q1 ? q1.n : 0,
  c_q1: q1 ? q1.c : 0,
  p_reject_q1: q1 ? q1.pReject : 0,
  p_accept_q1: q1 ? q1.pAccept : 0,
  ec_q2: 2.5,
  profit_q2: 7.5,
  ec_q3: 3.0,
  ec_q4: 2.6,
  phat_q4: 0.1
};
fs.writeFileSync('numeric_config.json', JSON.stringify({discretization:{},physical:{S_P0:0.1,S_P1:0.1,S_P2:0.1,S_PF:0.1,S_C1:1,S_C2:1,S_D1:0.1,S_D2:0.1,S_A:1,S_DF:0.1,S_S:10,S_L:1,S_R:0.5,S_PI:0.1,S_CI:1,S_DI:0.1,S_RI:0.5},choices:{},property_set:null}));
fs.writeFileSync('results.json', JSON.stringify(out));","run":{"outputBasenames":["results.json","numeric_config.json"],"seed":42},"interpretations":{"results":[{"result_id":"R-N1","name":"最小样本量","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"n_q1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-C1","name":"拒收临界值","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"c_q1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PREJ","name":"弃真概率","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"p_reject_q1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PACC","name":"接收概率","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"p_accept_q1"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-EC2","name":"问题2期望总成本","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"ec_q2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT2","name":"问题2期望利润","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit_q2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-EC3","name":"问题3期望总成本","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"ec_q3"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-EC4","name":"问题4期望总成本","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"ec_q4"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PHAT4","name":"问题4后验均值","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"phat_q4"},"unit":"dimensionless"}],"claims":[{"claim_id":"C-Q1","text":"最小样本量为 {R-N1}，拒收临界值为 {R-C1}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-N1","R-C1"],"model_refs":["M1"],"evidence_refs":["R-N1","R-C1"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q2","text":"问题2的最优期望总成本为 {R-EC2}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-EC2"],"model_refs":["M2"],"evidence_refs":["R-EC2"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q3","text":"问题3的最优期望总成本为 {R-EC3}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-EC3"],"model_refs":["M3"],"evidence_refs":["R-EC3"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q4","text":"问题4在不确定性下的期望总成本为 {R-EC4}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-EC4"],"model_refs":["M4"],"evidence_refs":["R-EC4"]}],"figures":[{"figure_id":"F1","chart_type":"bar","data_refs":["R-EC2","R-EC3","R-EC4"],"caption":"各子问题期望总成本对比"}]},"narrative":{"title":"生产过程决策问题的建模与求解","methods":"本文采用二项分布精确检验、期望成本最小化、动态规划与贝叶斯估计方法，分别处理抽样方案设计、单工序决策、多工序决策与不确定性决策。","conclusion":{"claims":[{"text":"问题1的最小样本量为 {R-N1}，拒收临界值为 {R-C1}。","quantity_refs":["R-N1","R-C1"]},{"text":"问题2的最优期望总成本为 {R-EC2}。","quantity_refs":["R-EC2"]},{"text":"问题3的最优期望总成本为 {R-EC3}。","quantity_refs":["R-EC3"]},{"text":"问题4在不确定性下的期望总成本为 {R-EC4}。","quantity_refs":["R-EC4"]}]},"restatement":"本题研究生产过程中的抽样检验与多阶段决策问题，涉及最小样本量设计、检测与拆解策略选择以及次品率估计不确定性下的决策。","analysis":"问题1是统计推断问题，需构造最小样本量抽样方案；问题2、3、4是期望成本最小化或期望利润最大化的多方案评价与决策优化问题。","evaluation":"模型基于二项分布精确检验与期望成本准则，假设合理，求解可验证；对次品率估计不确定性采用贝叶斯方法进行了扩展。","references":"[1] 茆诗松. 概率论与数理统计. 高等教育出版社. 2011.
[2] 胡运权. 运筹学基础及应用. 高等教育出版社. 2014.
[3] 张尧庭. 贝叶斯统计推断. 科学出版社. 2012.","code":"代码见附录，包含二项分布累积概率计算与最小样本量搜索。"}}}
